1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
This is everything Sawn is: two files, no
server, no installation, no API key.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:25,000
The platform, and the retrieval simulator
with our evaluation set.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Scenario one, the problem. I sign in as
the Al Baha education department.

4
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Sorted by the date on the form, watch the
last row:

5
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000
a chained emergency exit should sit at the
bottom.

6
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:59,740
There it is. Position fourteen of
fourteen,

7
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:10,000
thirteen older requests ahead. First come,
first served.

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Scenario two, the rule. Eight published
weights that sum to one hundred.

9
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:33,666
Fifty-two per cent on physical safety, and
the rule:

10
00:01:33,666 --> 00:01:45,000
structural or electrical at eight is
Critical, whatever the number.

11
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:51,272
Scenario three, the same queue under the
rule.

12
00:01:51,272 --> 00:02:00,000
I click By risk; the chained exit should
jump to the top three.

13
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Position three, up eleven places,
Critical, twenty-four hour clock running.

14
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:19,160
The eight indicators, the score,

15
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:28,000
and one generated explanation sentence. No
rank leaves without one.

16
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:42,582
Scenario four, where the authority comes
from.

17
00:02:42,582 --> 00:02:50,000
This fault retrieved the fire code, SBC
801.

18
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:02,653
I ask the knowledge base who must inspect
a blocked fire exit;

19
00:03:02,653 --> 00:03:10,000
the answer should carry its source.

20
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:15,892
SBC 801, with authority and link.

21
00:03:15,892 --> 00:03:25,000
The system did not write a rule; it
retrieved one.

22
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:32,325
Scenario five, the part most systems hide.

23
00:03:32,325 --> 00:03:40,000
A question no published instrument
answers.

24
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:44,827
The correct behaviour is a refusal,

25
00:03:44,827 --> 00:03:52,000
and the question should drop into the gap
register.

26
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:58,381
Seven regression questions, one per gap in
our report,

27
00:03:58,381 --> 00:04:05,000
already here. Gaps are an output of
running the system.

28
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Scenario six, accountability. I open a
handled request as the school principal.

29
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:24,455
The company, its registration,

30
00:04:24,455 --> 00:04:35,000
the supervising engineer and his council
number, the dates in and out.

31
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,700
Handover notes,
and two signature fingerprints

32
00:04:38,700 --> 00:04:42,475
computed over the declaration.

33
00:04:42,475 --> 00:04:45,000
A later edit breaks them.

34
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:48,473
Scenario seven, proof.

35
00:04:48,473 --> 00:05:00,000
The simulator runs the question stage by
stage against the fitted index.

36
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:05,769
Ninety-five per cent first-hit accuracy,

37
00:05:05,769 --> 00:05:15,000
seven of seven uncovered questions
refused, one honest failure.

38
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:23,613
I lower the coverage floor to 0.20 and
miscitations climb.

39
00:05:23,613 --> 00:05:30,000
The threshold is an argument you can drag.

40
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,084
Scenario eight, changing the policy
safely.

41
00:05:36,084 --> 00:05:45,000
I raise People affected from ten to
twenty-two in the sandbox.

42
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:51,272
The counterfactual: which requests would
move,

43
00:05:51,272 --> 00:06:00,000
and the small-versus-large school gap
opening from zero to two.

44
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,232
Nothing has been applied.

45
00:06:02,232 --> 00:06:07,741
A weight change ships only as a versioned
committee decision.

46
00:06:07,741 --> 00:06:10,000
That is Y.3181, working.

47
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:18,052
The impact: 24,075 schools on one
comparable scale;

48
00:06:18,052 --> 00:06:25,000
a chained fire exit waits hours, not
weeks.

49
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:30,737
Every rank carries its regulation; nothing
closes without a signature.

50
00:06:30,737 --> 00:06:35,000
The AI decides the order, a human signs
the action.

51
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:43,611
Built on ITU-T Y.3172 and Y.3181 and 23
published instruments;

52
00:06:43,611 --> 00:06:50,000
seven gaps offered back to policy and to
ITU.

53
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:55,000
Sawn. Which school cannot wait.

